Subject: [PATCH] DAT-101: Preserve and inspect authorized Parquet draft
 uploads

Use one seekable original for bounded decoding and custody. Verify real Parquet and CSV with TLS and PostgreSQL in a loopback-only fixture, including interruption, atomic rollback, corrupt custody and independent scoped replay.
